page.vuka.html:20:28: <ui.Suspense wait> takes a duration written as a string, such as wait="200ms"; a Go duration that is not negative: "150ms", "1s"; "0s" turns a delay off
page.vuka.html:20:40: <ui.Suspense delay> takes a duration written as a string, such as delay="200ms"; a Go duration that is not negative: "150ms", "1s"; "0s" turns a delay off
page.vuka.html:20:52: <ui.Suspense minShow> takes a duration written as a string, such as minShow="200ms"; a Go duration that is not negative: "150ms", "1s"; "0s" turns a delay off
